00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.913
Hospital Information System, EHR and Telemedicine.

2
00:00:04.193 --> 00:00:09.078
Chapter I04, from the Industry Designs part of the System Design Playbook.

3
00:00:10.828 --> 00:00:11.788
At a glance:

4
00:00:12.068 --> 00:00:13.241
Chapter at a glance.

5
