90 min.

15
00:01:33.686 --> 00:01:34.433
Warning:

16
00:01:34.713 --> 00:01:36.825
Clinical and regulatory content.

17
00:01:37.105 --> 00:01:40.283
This is an engineering design, not clinical guidance.

18
00:01:40.563 --> 00:01:49.267
Clinical scores (NEWS2, triage levels), drug-interaction logic and treatment pathways must be validated and owned by clinicians.

19
00:01:49.547 --> 00:02:03.030
Statements about Indian law and programmes (DPDP Act 2023, ABDM, Telemedicine Practice Guidelines 2020, NHCX, record retention) are summaries marked VERIFY.

20
